<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to Goldenrod’s Radio Tower!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to Goldenrod’s Radio Tower!\r...Or, maybe not.\nI am sorry to tell you this, but no one\fcan visit the tower now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Um, yes. I have been telling visitors\nto go home as you instructed...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We have a special Quiz campaign!\rAnswer five questions correctly in a\nrow to win a Radio Card!\rWhen you load it into the Pokégear, you\nwill be able to listen to the radio...\fanytime, anywhere!\rWould you like to try our Quiz? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The first question!\rCan you check the Town Map with\nyour Pokégear? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You are correct.\nThe second question!\rNIDORINA can only be female.\nTrue? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You are correct.\nThe third question!\rKurt, the Poké Ball creator, uses\napricots as ingredients? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You are correct again.\nThe fourth question!\rIt’s impossible to use a TM on\nMAGIKARP. True? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wow!\nI have only one more question to go.\rIn Professor Oak’s popular show,\nPokémon Talk, is he on with Marie? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bingo! You got it!\nCongratulations!\fHere’s your prize, a Radio Card!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} can now listen to the\nradio with the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please tune in to our radio shows!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, dear.\nSorry, but you got it wrong.\fPlease try again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh. I see.\nPlease see me if you change your mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ben is a fabulous DJ!\nHis sweet voice just makes me melt!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I love Mary from Pokémon Talk.\rI only know what she sounds like,\nthough!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who are you?\nWe have some business going on.\rI was told not to let anyone pass but\nTeam Rocket!\rDo you understand?\rYou are only allowed to come through\nwhen you are wearing the cool black\funiform for Team Rocket!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ha! You must be new!\nYou look pretty good in the Team Rocket\funiform!\rGo on ahead!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What are you doing?\nGo upstairs and take your position!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}: Hey, Team Rocket!\rStop going around in groups and\ntroubling people. You cowards!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}: ...Huh?\nAre you {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\fWhat are you doing here?\rNo way... You think you’re strong now\nthat you look like them?\rThat’s foolish!\nYou shouldn’t wear those things!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? You!\nYou’re not a newcomer?\fThen battle with me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You are too powerful.\rYou could spoil our plan.\nI have to inform the others...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}: I see.\nYou were trying to be sneaky...\rHuh!\nA typical idea of the meek!\rNo matter.\nI’ll let you handle this.\rI have to defeat the Dragon Tamer...\nWhat’s his name...? Lance!\rAfter that...it will be your turn.\nBe ready for it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1F Reception\n2F Sales\f3F Personnel\f4F Production\f5F Director’s Office\f6F Observation Deck</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lucky Channel!\nWin with Pokémon ID numbers!\rTrade your Pokémon to collect different\nID numbers!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is the Pokémon Lottery Corner.\nI’m Felicity, your attendant today.\rIf the drawn number matches the ID No.\nof any of your Pokémon, you could win\ffabulous gifts.\rWould you like to check today’s\nlucky number? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You’ve already drawn a Loto Ticket\ntoday. Please come back tomorrow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh. I see.\nPlease do visit us again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">First, I’ll look up today’s Pokémon\nLottery Corner lucky number.\r...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Loto Ticket number is {STRVAR_1 54, 0, 0}.\rNow, let’s see if it matches the\nID No. of any of your Pokémon.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congratulations!\rThe ID No. of your team’s\n{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} matches your Loto\fTicket number!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congratulations!\rThe ID No. of your PC-boxed\n{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} matches your Loto\fTicket number!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m sorry.\nYou didn’t get a match...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The last digit matched, so you\nwin the fourth prize!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gained a new Backdrop for use\nin Fitting Rooms.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The last two digits matched, so you\nwin the third prize!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The last three digits matched, so you\nwin the second prize!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The last four digits matched, so you\nwin the first prize!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, my goodness, all five digits\nmatched!\rYou’ve won the jackpot prize!\nThis is just so incredible!\r...Oh, I’m sorry! Your prize!\nI got carried away there.\rHere you go!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Oh?\nYou seem to have no room for this.\rPlease make room in your Bag and\nthen let me know.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nYes, I’ve been expecting you.\rThis is the prize we’ve been holding\nfor you. Here you go!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please do visit again!\nGood-bye from Felicity, your attendant!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is the Pokémon Lottery Corner.\rWould you like to check today’s\nlucky number again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL (on air): --and that’s the\nthing, that’s the THING, that’s\fwhat nobody wants to say out loud:\nit’s not one incident.\rAzalea was not one incident.\r(A girl waves you quiet--\nthe show’s on.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL (on air): A well full of\nSLOWPOKE in a town that’s loved\fthose SLOWPOKE for a hundred\nyears, and somebody was down there\fdoing something to them.\rFine. Terrible, but fine, file it,\nmove on--except.\rExcept I’ve got a missing-Pokémon\nreport out of the Ruins of Alph.\fEquipment nobody can identify on a\nroute near Violet.\f“Researchers” at three sites that\ndidn’t ask for any researchers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL (on air): Now I’m not saying\nit’s connected. I would NEVER say\fa thing I can’t prove on air, my\nproducer is making a face at me\fright now.\rI’m just saying--when you’ve\ndone this as long as I have, you\flearn the shape of a thing before\nyou can name it.\rAnd this has a shape. This has a\nvery particular shape.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL (on air): Somebody is running\na quiet little operation across\fthis whole region, polite and\nprofessional and gone before\fanyone gets a good look.\rAnd one day somebody is going to\nget a good look. And when they do--\fthey should call ME first.\rWe’re back after this.\r(The on-air light clicks off.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: That was SO good. That was\nincredible.\rOkay, okay--Ms. Mel, hi, I’m a\nhuge fan, but you don’t have to\ftake my word about Azalea being\nreal because--\rbecause THIS one was THERE.\nDown in the Well. While it was\fhappening. My friend went IN.\rSaw the whole thing. Tell her!\nTell her about the--</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: In the Well. You were in the\nWell.\rOkay. Okay okay okay. Don’t move,\ndon’t leave, you are the most\finteresting person who has walked\nthrough that door in a YEAR.\rWhat did you see. Start anywhere.\nStart at the worst part.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: How many of them?--no, don’t\ncount, ballpark. What did they\fwear? Were they loud, were they\nscared, did they run?\rPeople who run are amateurs.\nDid they run?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: Equipment. There’s always\nequipment. Cases, tablets,\fsomething with a logo on it--\npeople never stamp the IMPORTANT\fstuff but they ALWAYS stamp the\nEXPENSIVE stuff.\rWas there a name on anything.\nAnything at all. Think.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: A lab coat. On the gear.\nA coat with a stamp on it.\rWhat did the stamp say.\r...Silph. You said SILPH.\nSilph Co.\rSay it once more and don’t think\nabout it, the first answer’s the\ftrue one--what was on the coat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: Silph. SILPH.\rI have been pulling that thread\nfor a year and a half and every\ftime I get close it goes soft in\nmy hands. Lawyers. “No comment.”\fDoors that lock from the inside.\rAnd you--a KID off the forest\nroad--you just walked in and\fhanded me the one thing I could\nnever get:\fa witness who saw the name in the\ndirt.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: Right. Okay. Here’s what’s\nhappening. The Magnet Train\freopened last week--last WEEK, do\nyou understand what the odds of\fthat are--\rSilph Co. headquarters is in\nSaffron. That’s Kanto. That’s\ftwo hours on the fast rail and I\nhave a pass and you have a face\fthat saw the coat.\rYou’re coming with me. Right now.\nGrab your bag, we are going to go\flook the dragon in the lobby.\rDon’t overthink it. Overthinking\nis just fear wearing a smart coat.\fLet’s GO.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: Station’s the south side of\ntown. Don’t overthink it.\rOverthinking is just fear wearing\na smart coat. GO.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: TRAIN’S NOT GONNA WAIT,\nWITNESS!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Wait. Wait wait wait--\nKanto? You’re going to KANTO?\fWith--with HER? On a TRAIN?\nRight now??</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL: I’m not taking anyone, kid.\nYour friend’s got legs and a\fstory in their pocket. They can\nsay no.\rThey’re not going to say no.\nNobody interesting ever says no.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: ...You’re actually gonna\ngo. Of course you’re gonna go.\fLook at you.\rKanto. With a stranger. On a\ntrain.\rThat is the single most reckless,\nmost CHAMPION thing I have ever\fheard and I HATE that it’s not\nme doing it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: I’m not coming. Don’t--\ndon’t make that face, I’m NOT.\rThis is your crazy thing, not\nmine. I’ve got a city to figure\fout and a team to build and\nsomebody in this dumb friendship\fhas to stay the sensible one for\nONE day.\rGuess it’s my turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: One battle. Right now.\rIf you’re gonna go do something\nthis stupid, I am NOT letting you\fwalk onto that train soft.\rShow me you’re ready. Show me I\ndon’t have to worry.\fSend it out!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Okay. Okay. You’re really\ndoing this.\rGo look your dragon in the lobby,\nor whatever she said. Be the one\fwho saw it.\rThat’s--that’s actually really\ncool, I’m not gonna pretend it’s\fnot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: But you CALL me. The\nsecond it gets weird. And it’s\fgonna get weird, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}--\nyou’re going to a city built\faround the people you saw in that\nWell.\rOf COURSE it’s gonna get weird.\nSo you call me. Pokégear. Day or\fnight. Promise.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEL (from the door): TRAIN’S NOT\nGONNA WAIT, WITNESS!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Ugh. GO. Before I change\nmy mind and tackle you onto a\fdifferent train.\r...Smell ya later, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: The show’s about to\nstart! Get up front, you’ll miss\fit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0065_D23R0101_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Wait. Wait wait wait--\nKanto? You’re going to KANTO?\fWith--with HER? On a TRAIN?\nRight now??</language>
	</row>
</body>
